## Constraints

- Use ONLY the variable names you declared in the "variables" array within assertions.
- Every variable name referenced in a "functions" entry or "assertions" entry must appear in the "variables" array.
- Assertion IDs must be unique, non-empty, and match the pattern [A-Z][A-Z0-9_-]*.
- Assertion expressions must be syntactically valid SMT-LIB s-expressions with balanced parentheses.
- Do not include solver commands (check-sat, exit, push, pop) in assertions.
- Return only the JSON object. Do not include explanation or commentary.`;
